00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:44.480
An easy solution is to add CA or MX to the end of your existing SKU before uploading

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.430
it to Amazon.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:48.380
ca or Amazon.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:49.030
com.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:49.680
MX.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:56.760
